    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/4080f24d87a7b5db8d35b88bd75f9a71.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/4080f24d87a7b5db8d35b88bd75f9a71.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/4080f24d87a7b5db8d35b88bd75f9a71.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reef Defense</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced, intense tower defense game</strong> where relentless waves of crustaceans are coming for your precious eggs! <strong>Can you outlast the swarm, or will your eggs become crab food?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/788d8aaf16e5463848666037e82b7f49.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/788d8aaf16e5463848666037e82b7f49.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/788d8aaf16e5463848666037e82b7f49.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arm your reef with strategically-positioned defenses and <strong>hold the line</strong>. Adapt to the evolving enemy tactics, upgrade your defenses on the fly and unleash powerful counterattacks before you're overwhelmed! <strong>Will you stop the enemies in time?</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/1b9778670489c45278e5453191a95ad7.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/1b9778670489c45278e5453191a95ad7.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/1b9778670489c45278e5453191a95ad7.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture to every island and uncover the mysteries hidden beneath the waves - the many reefs have <strong>secrets</strong> of their own, filled with <strong>treasures</strong> waiting to be found. As you protect your precious eggs, stay sharp and see if you can find every wonder the reef has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/5911ae46904875fad5f58dcb2fc31ee8.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/5911ae46904875fad5f58dcb2fc31ee8.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/5911ae46904875fad5f58dcb2fc31ee8.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between levels, head back to your <strong>home reef</strong> to feed your fish and  decorate with <strong>over 100 unique items</strong>\u2014like vibrant coral, curious critters, and shimmering shells!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/4080f24d87a7b5db8d35b88bd75f9a71.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/4080f24d87a7b5db8d35b88bd75f9a71.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/4080f24d87a7b5db8d35b88bd75f9a71.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Reef Defense</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced, intense tower defense game</strong> where relentless waves of crustaceans are coming for your precious eggs! <strong>Can you outlast the swarm, or will your eggs become crab food?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/788d8aaf16e5463848666037e82b7f49.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/788d8aaf16e5463848666037e82b7f49.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/788d8aaf16e5463848666037e82b7f49.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arm your reef with strategically-positioned defenses and <strong>hold the line</strong>. Adapt to the evolving enemy tactics, upgrade your defenses on the fly and unleash powerful counterattacks before you're overwhelmed! <strong>Will you stop the enemies in time?</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/1b9778670489c45278e5453191a95ad7.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/1b9778670489c45278e5453191a95ad7.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/1b9778670489c45278e5453191a95ad7.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Venture to every island and uncover the mysteries hidden beneath the waves - the many reefs have <strong>secrets</strong> of their own, filled with <strong>treasures</strong> waiting to be found. As you protect your precious eggs, stay sharp and see if you can find every wonder the reef has to offer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/5911ae46904875fad5f58dcb2fc31ee8.poster.avif?t=1750443407\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/5911ae46904875fad5f58dcb2fc31ee8.webm?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/343160/extras/5911ae46904875fad5f58dcb2fc31ee8.mp4?t=1750443407\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between levels, head back to your <strong>home reef</strong> to feed your fish and  decorate with <strong>over 100 unique items</strong>\u2014like vibrant coral, curious critters, and shimmering shells!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
